	"name": "Assess the Field",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/environment/settlement/watchtower-wood-simple.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 13th level, your scouting ability is unparalleled. You gain a 10ft bonus to your movement speed and the ability to assess enemy forces. While hidden, you may spend 1 minute to assess an enemy camp, fortification, or marching column. When you do so, you know how many soldiers or units they possess, the classes of any commanders or leaders, and whether the CR or level of any 6 creatures you choose within the group is higher or lower than your own. You are also able to report patrol schedules, the locations where the commanders will take long rests, and where the food and weaponry are stored.</p>",
